{"ordinal":15071,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452220329992","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Raskolnikov_Armpit_Gun_0b7f1a1","source":"Raskolnikov: Однажды ты попадёшь на того, кто отнимет это ружьё. И тогда, как бы, конец тебе.","target":"Raskolnikov: Într-o zi vei da peste cineva care îți va lua pușca. Și atunci, cum să spun, o să fie sfârșitul tău.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-380.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15072,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452220329991","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Raskolnikov_Armpit_Gun_0dede43","source":"Raskolnikov: Ты же знаешь, что не все так спокойно будут реагировать на угрозу оружием.","target":"Raskolnikov: Știi că nu toți vor primi la fel de calm o amenințare cu arma.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-380.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15073,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452220329990","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Raskolnikov_Armpit_Gun_0f9823c","source":"Raskolnikov: Даже если я не выгляжу опасно…","target":"Raskolnikov: Chiar dacă nu par periculos…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-380.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
