{"ordinal":15077,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452220329986","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Raskolnikov_Eyes_Gun_0774d59","source":"Raskolnikov: Ты ведь видишь… что я уже почти не сплю.","target":"Raskolnikov: Vezi și tu… că aproape nu mai dorm deloc.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-380.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
